+distributed with the Python standard library, but are available from
+http://wwwsearch.sf.net/):
+
+                        CookieJar____
+                        /     \      \
+            FileCookieJar      \      \
+             /    |   \         \      \
+ MozillaCookieJar | LWPCookieJar \      \
+                  |               |      \
+                  |   ---MSIEBase |       \
